  Graph.addEdge(mutable, a, b, "A->B")
  Graph.addEdge(mutable, b, c, "B->C")
})
```

Creates an undirected graph, optionally with initial mutations.

**Example** (Creating an undirected graph)

```ts
import { Graph } from "effect"

